var e=[{id:`n_1`,type:`scene_change`,speaker:null,text:null,stage:{bg:`LIFETIME`,bg_animation:null,bgm:`CUTSCENE_HOPE`,filter:`NCFT_NORMAL`,slots:{L:null,C:null,R:null}}},{id:`n_2`,type:`dialog`,speaker:`KYLE_DELTA_AP_NULL`,text:{KOREA:`떠나기 전에 사장님의 방만한 경영 태도는 고쳐 드려야겠어요. 사장님만 바라보는 직원들의 앞날을 위해서라도, 24시간 곁을 지키겠습니다. 잔소리도 빼놓지 않을 테니 각오하세요, 아셨죠?`,JPN:`ここを去る前に、社長の適当な経営態度は直さなければなりません。社長だけを信じている社員の未来のためにも、24時間そばで見守ります。小言も多くなるでしょうが、覚悟しておいてくださいね？`,ENG:`I'd better do something about your lax attitude as a leader before I leave. I'm going to stay with you twenty-four seven, for the other employees who rely on you for their livelihood. This also means I'm not going to hold back if there's something I want to say to you. Get it?`,TWN:`離開之前，我要改掉老闆散漫的經營態度。為了老闆的員工們，我會24小時守在你身邊。但也少不了嘮叨，你要做好心理準備哦。`},stage:{bg:`LIFETIME`,bg_animation:null,bgm:`CUTSCENE_HOPE`,filter:`NCFT_NORMAL`,slots:{L:null,C:{char_id:`KYLE_DELTA_AP_NULL`,face:`UNIT_LAUGH`,hologram:!1},R:null}}}];export{e as default};